=\"Bdlpw\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue9461be7\" id=\"ue9461be7\">变量</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u157f2f8d\" id=\"u157f2f8d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub2da9f7b\" id=\"ub2da9f7b\">变量</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub23c23fa\" id=\"ub23c23fa\">是用来描述计算机中的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u62d0c33c\" id=\"u62d0c33c\">数据存储空间</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue324e765\" id=\"ue324e765\">的，我们可以通过变量来保存定义的数据</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"M26xw\" id=\"M26xw\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueae26e0f\" id=\"ueae26e0f\">变量定义</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u7bdf85a9\" id=\"u7bdf85a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58a6fea6\" id=\"u58a6fea6\">变量名 = 变量值</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%95%B4%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnage%20%3D%2030%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E6%B5%AE%E7%82%B9%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnscore%20%3D%2070.5%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%B8%83%E5%B0%94%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnb%20%3D%20True%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6%E4%B8%B2%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%5Cnname%20%3D%20'%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89'%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22wHSEc%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7d299201\" id=\"u7d299201\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueb5a5dd0\" id=\"ueb5a5dd0\">可以通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1d7cc625\" id=\"u1d7cc625\"><span data-lake-id=\"u59badf42\" id=\"u59badf42\">type()</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf31030be\" id=\"uf31030be\">函数